  "interpretation": "<p><strong>Mutated IGHV (95.2% homology):</strong><br>Indicates favorable prognosis in Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia (CLL).<br>Typically associated with better response to chemotherapy and longer survival.</p>\n<p><strong>Unmutated IGHV (&gt;98% homology):</strong><br>Associated with poor prognosis, more aggressive disease, and inferior response to chemoimmunotherapy.</p>",
